-- Rollback for vdi-3477-md-verification-pack.sql (2026-09-05 md pass, written 2026-09-07).
-- Reverts ONLY rows this pack touched (identified by the verification_note tag) and ONLY for standard VDI-3477
-- (joined through worksheet_templates -> standards.code).
-- Prior state, taken from the prod export made for this pass:
--   * all 89 active fields carried verification_status = imported_unverified (0 verified_against_standard,
--     0 corrected), verification_quote = null, verification_note = null, verified_at = null;
--   * 16 equations already carried verification_status = verified_against_standard with a NULL quote, so the
--     pack only backfilled quote/note/verified_at — this rollback clears those three and LEAVES the status;
--   * 2 equations (Gl.B1, Gl.B3) carried verified_via_cross_reference and are restored to that value.
-- No transaction control in this file: apply-pack.mjs supplies BEGIN/COMMIT and implements --dry-run by rolling
-- back; an inline commit would end that transaction early and turn a dry run into a real apply.

-- ---- fields (status + quote + note + verified_at) — prior status = imported_unverified (89 rows) ----
